ssage indices 134–135 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\", \"source_role\": \"unknown\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s64\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:05d7055e5e40d9d3930bdb7f1d829de689ddd8b44db13acc7a40f99850551e5f\", \"start\": 101, \"end\": 107, \"text\": \"User:\\n\", \"source_role\": \"unknown\", \"source_message_indices\": []}, {\"id\": \"s65\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:05d7055e5e40d9d3930bdb7f1d829de689ddd8b44db13acc7a40f99850551e5f\", \"start\": 107, \"end\": 386, \"text\": \"User: Plus, I attended a salsa dancing class recently, but I felt so uncomfortable with the atmosphere, which was quite surprising to me. I had hoped to find joy and freedom in the dance, as I’d heard so many wonderful stories about how liberating and exhilarating salsa can be. \", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [134]}, {\"id\": \"s66\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:05d7055e5e40d9d3930bdb7f1d829de689ddd8b44db13acc7a40f99850551e5f\", \"start\": 386, \"end\": 702, \"text\": \"Yet, it turned out that the intensity and enthusiasm of the other dancers left me feeling out of place, as if I were an outsider looking in on a vibrant world where I didn’t quite belong. The loud music, while catchy, created a chaotic environment that made it difficult for me to focus and connect with the rhythm. \", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [134]}, {\"id\": \"s67\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:05d7055e5e40d9d3930bdb7f1d829de689ddd8b44db13acc7a40f99850551e5f\", \"start\": 702, \"end\": 873, \"text\": \"Ultimately, I realized that dancing is not really my scene, and perhaps I should explore other recreational activities that align more with my comfort level and interests.\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [134]}, {\"id\": \"s68\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:05d7055e5e40d9d3930bdb7f1d829de689ddd8b44db13acc7a40f99850551e5f\", \"start\": 873, \"end\": 886, \"text\": \"\\n